# Rust
**/target/

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/
# CI (build-nuget.yml) builds and packs these per-RID at pack time; the C# project no longer
# carries a committed placeholder — keep a local one here for dev/test if you want (see the
# csproj's runtimes/**/native/* wildcard item), but it's regenerable via `cargo build --release`.
csharp/HyperUuid/runtimes/

# Gradle / Java
**/.gradle/
**/build/
# Same story as csharp/HyperUuid/runtimes/ above: CI (build-nuget.yml's pack-maven job)
# bundles all platforms' natives here at pack time; regenerable locally via
# `cargo build --release` for local dev/test.
java/src/main/resources/native/

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.venv/
**/dist/
**/.pytest_cache/
# Same story as csharp/HyperUuid/runtimes/ above: CI's "Place native lib for Python in-repo
# testing" step copies this leg's native lib here for `pytest` at build-native time;
# regenerable locally via `cargo build --release`.
python/src/hyperuuid/libhyperuuid.so

# Go
# Same story as csharp/HyperUuid/runtimes/ above: CI places each leg's native lib here for
# `go test` at build-native time; regenerable locally via `cargo build --release`. The
# go:embed directive needs *something* tracked to match, hence the README.md carve-out.
go/native/*/

# Swift
# Same story — SPM resources, CI-populated per leg, regenerable via `cargo build --release`.
swift/Sources/HyperUuid/NativeLibs/*/
**/.build/

# Ruby
# Same story — CI places each leg's native lib here for `bundle exec rspec` at build-native
# time; regenerable locally via `cargo build --release`.
ruby/lib/hyperuuid/native/*/
ruby/Gemfile.lock
ruby/pkg/

# PHP
# Same story — CI places each leg's native lib here for `phpunit` at build-native time;
# regenerable locally via `cargo build --release`.
php/src/native/*/
php/vendor/
php/composer.lock
php/.phpunit.result.cache

# IDE
.idea/
.vs/
